        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>古诗六首</title>\n<script type=\"text/javascript\" async\n  src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\">\n</script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #f0c98a;\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: center;\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"STSong\", serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    background: #f0c98a;\n    padding: 14px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .grid-frame {\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(#e9e2c8 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, #e9e2c8 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 20px 20px;\n    background-color: #fdfaf0;\n    border: 2px solid #8a8a8a;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n    grid-template-rows: 1fr 1fr 1fr;\n  }\n  .cell {\n    border: 1px solid #b0855a;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    padding: 14px 18px 18px 18px;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .title {\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 4px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .author {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n  .poem {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    text-align: left;\n    align-self: flex-start;\n    margin-left: 6px;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"grid-frame\">\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《登鹳雀楼》</div>\n      <div class=\"author\">（唐－王之涣）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        白日依山尽，<br>\n        黄河入海流。<br>\n        欲穷千里目，<br>\n        更上一层楼。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《静夜思》</div>\n      <div class=\"author\">（唐－李白）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        床前明月光，<br>\n        疑是地上霜。<br>\n        举头望明月，<br>\n        低头思故乡。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《古朗月行》</div>\n      <div class=\"author\">（唐－李白）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        小时不识月，<br>\n        呼作白玉盘。<br>\n        又疑瑶台镜，<br>\n        飞在青云端。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《寻隐者不遇》</div>\n      <div class=\"author\">（唐－贾岛）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        松下问童子，<br>\n        言师采药去。<br>\n        只在此山中，<br>\n        云深不知处。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《咏鹅》</div>\n      <div class=\"author\">（唐－骆宾王）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        鹅鹅鹅，<br>\n        曲项向天歌。<br>\n        白毛浮绿水，<br>\n        红掌拨清波。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"cell\">\n      <div class=\"title\">《草》</div>\n      <div class=\"author\">（唐－白居易）</div>\n      <div class=\"poem\">\n        离离原上草，<br>\n        一岁一枯荣。<br>\n        野火烧不尽，<br>\n        春风吹又生。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
